BITVAVO_KEY=
    BITVAVO_SECRET=
    # ... and so on
    ```

### 3. Professional Project Structure
Organize your `portfolio_tracker` folder to look like this. This makes `main.py` much cleaner because it just imports logic from the other folders.

```text
Damian-CLOUD/
├── .gitignore
├── .env
├── .env.example
├── requirements.txt
└── portfolio_tracker/
    ├── main.py
    ├── connectors/
    │   ├── __init__.py
    │   ├── bitvavo.py
    │   └── wallet_tracker.py
    ├── agents/
    │   ├── __init__.py
    │   ├── summary_agent.py
    │   └── research_agent.py
    └── utils/
        ├── __init__.py
        └── helpers.py